%% title: The path of dues
%% desc: A new bill raises the student's dues. A payment or discount lowers them. Once the student has paid in full, they leave the list. From a row you can collect the fee or send a reminder.
flowchart TD
  B["A bill is created"] --> D["Student's dues go up"]
  D --> L["Student appears in the list"]:::admin
  L --> A{"From the row"}:::note
  A -->|"Collect fee"| R["Record payment page"]:::admin
  A -->|"Remind"| M["Reminder sent<br/>Last reminder updates"]
  R --> P["Payment or discount is applied"]
  P --> Q{"Fully paid?"}:::note
  Q -->|"No"| D2["Dues go down<br/>student stays in the list"]
  Q -->|"Yes"| X["Student leaves the list"]
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
